--TEST--
Twig reports a PCRE failure when the "matches" subject is not valid UTF-8
--TEMPLATE--
{{ subject matches regexp }}
--DATA--
return ['subject' => "\xC3\x28abc", 'regexp' => '/^\p{L}+$/u'];
--EXCEPTION--
Twig\Error\RuntimeError: Regexp "/^\p{L}+$/u" passed to "matches" failed: Malformed UTF-8 characters, possibly incorrectly encoded in "index.twig" at line 2.
